      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "In the event, the office objections are complied with, list the matter before the Court at the appropriate stage without a memo.\"\nEven today, the learned counsel for petitioners has not complied with the office objections.\nTherefore, the petition is dismissed for its non-prosecution.\nSd/-\n(M.NAGAPRASANNA) JUDGE KG Syed Munnaf Pasha @ Munaf vs State Of Karnataka on 13 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/94592886/\n3",
